  {
    "id": "session_amplitude_spectrum",
    "name": "Amplitude Spectrum",
    "equation": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>scale</mi><mo>·</mo><mo>|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>FFT</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>scale</mi><mo>·</mo><mo>|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>FFT</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math>",
    "tooltip": "Frequency amplitudes of COP (unitless ratios vs Hz).",
    "description": ["f_k: frequency bin (Hz)", "scale: 2/N or 1/N ÷ Hann coherent gain."]
